WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:06.278
Preview on every device

2
00:00:06.788 --> 00:00:11.244
The preview beside the page shows the chapter exactly as it will print.

3
00:00:11.245 --> 00:00:24.640
Switch devices to see it as a paperback, a Kindle, a phone or a tablet.

4
00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:32.620
Turn pages and chapters with the buttons underneath.

5
00:00:32.623 --> 00:00:42.433
Drag the grip, or use the arrows on its edge, to make the preview wider or narrower.
